OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity care downgraded amid
OL,4,Astaff shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff shortages at a busy maternity
OL,7,Funit left some women facing long delays
OL,8,Fand unable to give birth where they
OL,9,Fchose, inspectors found.
OL,11,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,12,Fdowngraded maternity care at Queen
OL,13,FAlexandra (QA) Hospital in Portsmouth
OL,14,Ffrom "good" to "requires improvement",
OL,15,Falong with birth centres at St Mary's
OL,16,FCommunity Health Campus, also in
OL,17,FPortsmouth, and Gosport War Memorial
OL,18,FHospital.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
