OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity care downgraded amid
OL,4,Astaff shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors said the QA unit was under
OL,7,Fhigh pressure on 267 days in a year,
OL,8,Fwith some women waiting more than six
OL,9,Fhours to start induction and others
OL,10,Fsent elsewhere.
OL,12,FBut women did tell inspectors they felt
OL,13,Fsafe and well cared for. Portsmouth
OL,14,FHospitals University NHS Trust has been
OL,15,Fasked to comment.
